# TV3 HIL bench — Cube Orange+ only (no servos)
# Apply after airframe 15000 reboot, then: param save
#
# Real TV3 firmware on FC. Not Prototype SIH.
# Desk mass gate uses unloaded estimate (2.263 kg). Pad / closed-loop
# HIL must set loaded mass: 3×G12 → 2.713, 3×F10 → 2.476. G8 is not flight-valid.

# Real-hardware bench: never leave PX4 HITL latched (it kills IMU + MAIN PWM).
SYS_HITL	0
TVC_MASS	2.263
TVC_THR_NOM	12.0
TVC_ALLOW_FIRE	0
TVC_IGN_GPIO_EN	0
TVC_FORCE_ARM	1
TVC_REQ_RTK	0
TVC_REQ_LINK	1
TVC_GEOFENCE_R	0.0
TVC_CTRL_HZ	100
TVC_COM_Z	0.5329
TVC_FORCE_W	0.25
TVC_MIS_MODE	0
